  "title": "AN EXPERIMENTAL INVESTIGATION OF NEUMANN\u2019S CONJECTURE",
  "authors_raw": "STEPHEN GILLES AND PETER HUSTON",
  "title_lines": [
   "AN EXPERIMENTAL INVESTIGATION OF NEUMANN\u2019S",
   "CONJECTURE"
  ],
  "abstract": "We use a large census of hyperbolic 3-manifolds to experimentally investigate a conjecture of Neumann regarding the Bloch Group. We present an augmented census including, for feasible invariant trace \ufb01elds, explicit man- ifolds (associated to that \ufb01eld) that appear to generate the Bloch group of that \ufb01eld. We also make use of Ptolemy coordinates to compute \u201cexotic volumes\u201d of representations, and attempt to realize these volumes as linear combinations of generator volumes. We thus present a large body of empirical support for Neumann\u2019s conjecture.",
